<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56657" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>emptying, depletion</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχὶ
				πεῖνα καὶ δίψα . . κενώσεις τινές εἰσι</span> . . ;
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				585b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				35b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				904.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>: —poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενέωσις</span></b> , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντου κ. ἀνὰ πέδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					107.12
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κένωσις βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					190.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοῦ γιγνώσκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm.Math.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>evacuation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>, interpol.in <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.50
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῶν οἰκείων</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρσις τῶν ἀλλοτρίων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).134
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>depletion, low diet</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήρωσις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Art.</u>
				49
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. σίτου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of the moon,
				<i>waning</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήρωσις</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.40U.
			</span></i></div>
